<h1>Your export is ready</h1>

<p>The copy of <strong><%= @site_name %></strong> you asked for is built: every post,
   page, book, newsletter, and drip, plus your subscriber list.</p>

<p><a href="<%= @exports_url %>">Sign in to download it</a></p>

<p>It includes your readers' email addresses, so it's only available to you, signed in, and
   it's deleted on <%= @export.expires_at.to_date.to_fs(:long) %>. You can request a fresh
   one any time.</p>

<p>— Kindred Quill</p>
